# Build-context whitelist for the root Dockerfile (main app / Hugging Face Space).
# BuildKit uses this file instead of the root .dockerignore (which belongs to Twin Studio).
# The deploy workflow also copies it to .dockerignore in the Space.
*
!Dockerfile
!requirements.deploy.txt
!crowd_reliability/
!dashboard/
!models/production/
!data/demo/
!deploy/hf_space/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
data/app.db
